{"cid": "Ugx-qvoX0nzwgurGGvx4AaABAg", "text": "Nice little amp, looking forward to hearing what it sounds like.\nI really like the idea of the digital synthesis chip. \nI really need to try and build myself a signal generator I wonder how well the chip in this amp would handle boosting a home made signal generator. Great job Paul, now I have a project idea to work on.", "time": "7 years ago", "author": "@mikeoliver3254", "channel": "UCd1_iw17V_XP1s8U4zQVidg", "votes": "0", "replies": "", "photo": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mjLNmGXPbs5cz0O31jiSYMml-Qqu-iIsSAvzyISuN9UVs=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "heart": true, "reply": false, "time_parsed": 1546032666.696128}
